---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageHeader from '@/components/PageHeader.astro';
import { site } from '@/data/site';
import { path } from '@/i18n/config';

const updated = new Intl.DateTimeFormat('en-GB', {
  day: 'numeric',
  month: 'long',
  year: 'numeric',
}).format(new Date('2026-09-08'));
---

<BaseLayout
  lang="en"
  title="Terms of use"
  description="Terms of use for sporretimen.no: what the content is (and is not), copyright, rules for the comments, disclaimer and third-party links."
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="Terms"
    title="Terms of use"
    lead="Simple, honest terms for how you may use sporretimen.no and the content published here."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container-narrow prose">
      <p class="muted">Last updated: {updated}</p>

      <h2>In short</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Spørretimen is a personal hobby project, not a registered company.</li>
        <li>
          The content is conversation, opinion and experience — not settled truth, and
          not professional advice (medical, for instance).
        </li>
        <li>You may read, listen and share links to the content freely. You may not copy it and publish it as your own.</li>
        <li>The comments are moderated, and inappropriate content is removed.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>What the content is</h2>
      <p>
        Spørretimen is a podcast of conversations about occupations, experiences and
        subjects people wonder about. What is shared in the episodes is the guests’ own
        experiences, opinions and judgements — not settled truth or official
        recommendations from Spørretimen. Where episodes deal with health, law, finance
        or other specialist fields, this is general information and personal experience,
        not individual advice. Consult a qualified professional before making decisions
        based on anything you hear here. See also{' '}
        <a href={path('en', 'ethics')}>press ethics and the content</a> for how we work
        editorially.
      </p>

      <h2>Copyright</h2>
      <p>
        Text, audio, images and other content on sporretimen.no is owned by Spørretimen
        or used with permission from the rights holder. You are welcome to read, listen
        and share links to the content. You may not copy it, republish it or use it
        commercially without an agreement. Content played through embedded YouTube and
        Spotify players is owned by, and governed by, YouTube’s and Spotify’s own terms
        respectively.
      </p>

      <h2>The comments</h2>
      <p>
        You may leave comments beneath episodes. Spørretimen reserves the right to
        remove comments that are harassing, offensive, unlawful or otherwise contrary to
        good conduct, without notice. See the{' '}
        <a href={path('en', 'privacy')}>privacy policy</a> for what is stored when you
        comment or leave a rating.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party links</h2>
      <p>
        The website may link to or display content from other sites, such as YouTube,
        Spotify or resources the guests mention. Spørretimen has no control over, and is
        not responsible for, the content on those external sites.
      </p>

      <h2>Disclaimer</h2>
      <p>
        The content on sporretimen.no is made available as it is, without warranties.
        Spørretimen is not responsible for decisions you make based on information or
        opinions appearing in episodes, articles or comments.
      </p>

      <h2>Governing law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by Norwegian law.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>
        We may update these terms as needed. Changes are published on this page with a
        new date at the top.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms can be sent to{' '}
        <a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=${encodeURIComponent('Terms – Spørretimen')}`}>
          {site.email}
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
